WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.915
Land of the Monkeys was very quiet.

2
00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:19.236
Dr. Dolittle could sense the sickness in the air.

3
00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:24.139
All around him were hundreds, no, thousands, of sick monkeys.

4
00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:26.280
Many had already died.

5
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:30.473
First, Dr.

6
00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:32.874
Dolittle separated the sick and the healthy.

7
00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:36.036
Dr. Dolittle's animals helped him.

8
00:00:36.056 --> 00:00:38.697
"Chee-Chee! Build me a hut!"

9
00:00:39.078 --> 00:00:39.578
he said.

10
00:00:39.598 --> 00:00:41.319
"Jip! Too-Too!

11
00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:43.400
Find the other monkeys in the land!

12
00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.381
Bring them here," he ordered.

13
00:00:45.401 --> 00:00:47.402
"Gub-Gub! Dab-Dab!

14
00:00:47.623 --> 00:00:49.344
Help Polynesia find some herbs!"

15
00:00:51.765 --> 00:00:52.465
Then Dr.

16
00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:56.628
Dolittle gave shots to the healthy monkeys so they wouldn't get sick.

17
00:00:57.244 --> 00:01:00.005
Meanwhile, the sick ones needed to be cared for.

18
00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:02.306
But there were just too many.

19
00:01:02.326 --> 00:01:09.228
"Doctor, we cannot do this by ourselves," Chee-Chee said tiredly.

20
00:01:09.248 --> 00:01:13.069
"We need help," admitted Polynesia.

21
00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.010
Dr. Dolittle thought for a moment.

22
00:01:16.971 --> 00:01:20.952
"Let's send out a message to the other animals in the jungle," he said.

23
00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:28.507
A few days later, the leaders of the lions, leopards, and antelope paid a visit to the doctor.

24
00:01:28.527 --> 00:01:31.629
"The monkeys need your help," Dr.

25
00:01:31.669 --> 00:01:32.769
Dolittle explained.

26
00:01:32.789 --> 00:01:34.290
"My help?

27
00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:37.191
Ha! I am the king of beasts!"

28
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.232
the proud lion roared.

29
00:01:39.752 --> 00:01:41.573
"Monkeys are dirty and smelly!

30
00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:43.434
I wouldn't even eat them!"

31
00:01:44.134 --> 00:01:47.756
With that, the lion turned up his nose and walked away.

32
00:01:48.912 --> 00:01:51.354
The leader of leopards looked at the doctor.

33
00:01:51.374 --> 00:01:54.795
"If the lion king doesn't help, then I won't help!"

34
00:01:55.176 --> 00:01:57.097
He too turned and walked away.

35
00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:01.419
"We feel bad for the monkeys, but we don't know how to help.

36
00:02:01.879 --> 00:02:02.560
I'm sorry."

37
00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:04.981
Even the antelope turned away.

38
00:02:05.001 --> 00:02:10.824
At home, the lioness was waiting for her husband.

39
00:02:10.844 --> 00:02:13.006
"One of the cubs is sick!"

40
00:02:13.546 --> 00:02:14.186
she cried.

41
00:02:14.206 --> 00:02:18.752
"I heard there is an animal doctor here," his wife continued.

42
00:02:18.772 --> 00:02:22.834
"Yes, I met him," the lion answered proudly.

43
00:02:23.474 --> 00:02:26.695
Then the lion told his wife what he had said to the doctor.

44
00:02:28.115 --> 00:02:30.016
The lioness was very angry.

45
00:02:30.036 --> 00:02:32.137
"Are you out of your mind?"

46
00:02:32.657 --> 00:02:33.317
she shouted.

47
00:02:33.337 --> 00:02:35.838
"He is here to help the animal world!"

48
00:02:36.518 --> 00:02:38.799
The proud lion suddenly turned red.

49
00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:41.599
"We need him to help our baby!"

50
00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:42.940
his wife roared.

51
00:02:43.848 --> 00:02:46.609
The lioness began pulling her husband's hair.

52
00:02:46.629 --> 00:02:49.851
"OUCH! OUCH!"

53
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:50.931
he cried.

54
00:02:50.951 --> 00:02:53.872
"Go back and tell him you're sorry!"

55
00:02:54.573 --> 00:02:55.233
she shouted.

56
00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:58.754
The lion did not want to lose all his hair.

57
00:02:59.715 --> 00:03:02.136
And he did not want his baby to be sick.

58
00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:06.077
And he did not want his wife to be angry with him.

59
00:03:06.838 --> 00:03:09.119
He knew he must help the monkeys.

60
00:03:09.139 --> 00:03:11.020
"Look! Dr.

61
00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:13.561
Dolittle!" Jip suddenly barked.

62
00:03:14.061 --> 00:03:16.182
It was the proud leader of the lions.

63
00:03:16.722 --> 00:03:19.204
He brought hundreds of other animals with him.

64
00:03:19.224 --> 00:03:21.965
"Uh, Dr.

65
00:03:22.025 --> 00:03:24.867
Dolittle, do you still need my help?"

66
00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:26.288
the lion asked.

67
00:03:27.908 --> 00:03:30.130
"Yes, we really do," Dr.

68
00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.070
Dolittle nodded.

69
00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:35.232
"I am King of the Jungle," the lion said proudly.

70
00:03:35.252 --> 00:03:38.494
"I know," the doctor replied kindly.

71
00:03:38.514 --> 00:03:43.596
"So I commanded the animals to come and help," the lion continued.

72
00:03:43.616 --> 00:03:47.157
"Thank you very much," replied the doctor.

73
00:03:48.258 --> 00:03:51.539
Every day, more and more jungle animals came to help.

74
00:03:52.139 --> 00:03:55.080
With their help, the monkeys got better quickly.

75
00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.401
Dr. Dolittle's work was almost done.

76
00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:02.902
Dr. Dolittle made a special visit to the lion's den.

77
00:04:02.922 --> 00:04:05.883
"Is my baby okay?"

78
00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:07.723
asked the worried lion.

79
00:04:07.743 --> 00:04:10.644
"He just needs this and he'll be fine."

80
00:04:12.212 --> 00:04:13.154
"Thank you, Dr.

81
00:04:13.194 --> 00:04:16.599
Dolittle," the leader of the lions bowed his head.

82
00:04:16.619 --> 00:04:18.783
"No, thank you.

83
00:04:19.344 --> 00:04:23.951
Without your help, the monkeys would have all died," said the doctor.
